OL,3,AMusk and Anthropic pledge public share
OL,4,Agiveaways
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthropic is laying the ground for a
OL,7,Fpotential blockbuster stock market
OL,8,Flisting that could value the firm at
OL,9,Fmore than $1tn (#750bn). SpaceX set the
OL,10,Frecord for biggest initial public
OL,11,Foffering (IPO) in history in June,
OL,12,Fraising $85.7bn.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
