OL,3,AWoman says she 'closed eyes and tried
OL,4,Anot to be there' during alleged Russell
OL,5,ABrand rape
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning - this report contains graphic
OL,8,Fcontent
OL,10,FA woman who alleges she was raped by
OL,11,FRussell Brand at a bar told the police
OL,12,F"I just closed my eyes and tried not to
OL,13,Fbe there" while the attack was taking
OL,14,Fplace.
OL,16,FIn a 2023 video interview with an
OL,17,Fofficer shown to the jury at his trial,
OL,18,Fthe woman said she had been speaking to
OL,19,FBrand about him hosting the Channel 4
OL,20,Fshow Big Brother's Big Mouth when he
OL,21,Fallegedly sexually assaulted her.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
