CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1792421289
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASelena Gomez says vaping has affected
OL,4,Aher voice
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's so stupid and it changed my
OL,7,Fvoice," she reiterated, then laughed:
OL,8,F"So if you guys don't like listening to
OL,9,Fmy voice, that's totally
OL,10,Funderstandable. I don't mind. Just
OL,11,Fdon't listen to it."
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
